OL,3,GNEWSAPedestrian dies after being hit by
OL,4,Acar
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pedestrian in his 50s has died after
OL,7,Fbeing hit by a car in Kent, police say.
OL,9,FKent Police said it was called at about
OL,10,F18:40 GMT on Sunday to the crash
OL,11,Foutside the Black Bull pub in
OL,12,FCanterbury Road, in Folkestone.
OL,14,FThe local man, who was on foot, was
OL,15,Fbelieved to have been hit by a black
OL,16,FVolkswagen Sharan, the force added.
OL,18,FAnyone with information which could
OL,19,Fhelp with the investigation is asked to
OL,20,Fcontact police.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
